WEBVTT

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:45.837 --> 00:46.671
You…

00:47.172 --> 00:48.381
Who are you?

00:48.465 --> 00:49.799
I am exactly what you see.

00:51.342 --> 00:53.303
I am a soul shifter

00:54.220 --> 00:55.221
with blue marks in my eyes.

00:55.930 --> 00:56.765
What?

00:56.848 --> 00:59.100
When the blue marks happened to reappear,

01:00.977 --> 01:02.353
I remembered who I was.

01:05.982 --> 01:07.192
I am not Jin Bu-yeon.

01:09.694 --> 01:10.862
My soul…

01:13.323 --> 01:14.449
belongs to someone else.

01:15.658 --> 01:16.493
Someone else?

01:16.576 --> 01:18.787
I ran away
because I did not want to get caught.

01:21.414 --> 01:22.499
But here we are.

01:26.503 --> 01:27.670
What will you do now?

01:29.464 --> 01:30.298
Jang Uk.

01:36.596 --> 01:37.639
Did you find her?

01:38.348 --> 01:39.808
Yes, I did. She is safe with me.

01:39.891 --> 01:42.101
Is she hurt? Are you all right?

01:42.185 --> 01:44.229
She was just startled by the wraiths.

01:44.312 --> 01:45.605
She is calming herself down.

01:46.523 --> 01:47.398
Do not worry.

01:47.482 --> 01:49.359
Is that so? There are wraiths?

01:49.442 --> 01:51.653
Come to think of it,
this is one dreary forest.

02:03.665 --> 02:05.959
The marks are only detectable
from this close.

02:07.377 --> 02:10.213
I will decide what to do with you.

02:11.089 --> 02:12.048
No one else should know.

02:12.632 --> 02:13.466
Keep it in mind.

02:14.217 --> 02:15.343
Only I am allowed

02:16.928 --> 02:17.929
to come this close.

02:21.224 --> 02:22.058
Fine.

02:25.019 --> 02:26.104
Only you are allowed…

02:28.022 --> 02:28.898
to come this close.

02:33.820 --> 02:37.240
Are you saying Naksu realized
who she truly was?

02:37.824 --> 02:38.992
I believe so.

02:39.075 --> 02:43.246
Now that Naksu has regained her memory,
will her soul leave the body?

02:43.329 --> 02:46.249
Will the body be Bu-yeon's entirely?

02:47.083 --> 02:48.501
Seo Yul told me.

02:50.170 --> 02:52.964
I will not blame you
for deceiving me, so please tell me.

02:53.548 --> 02:54.883
If Naksu's soul leaves the body

02:54.966 --> 02:57.760
and she becomes Bu-yeon again
while she is in Gwido,

02:57.844 --> 03:00.972
will she be able to come
out of there alive?

03:01.764 --> 03:02.849
She will be fine.

03:02.932 --> 03:05.226
Bu-yeon's soul has immense powers

03:05.310 --> 03:08.813
that even I fail to fathom.

03:15.570 --> 03:17.739
The one who attacked me earlier
was the wraith of this corpse.

03:17.822 --> 03:19.991
Unlike the other wraiths that avoided me,

03:20.783 --> 03:22.660
this one chased me.

03:22.744 --> 03:24.162
What is that blue object?

03:31.377 --> 03:33.296
This is an ice stone.

03:33.379 --> 03:36.090
An ice stone?
I did not know there was one in Gwido too.

03:36.174 --> 03:38.843
That ice stone has no energy of the sky.

03:38.927 --> 03:40.386
It is different from Uk's.

03:40.470 --> 03:43.348
It desires to absorb human energy

03:43.431 --> 03:45.183
like a soul shifter that has run wild.

03:45.266 --> 03:46.726
It is best that we let it be.

03:48.770 --> 03:50.813
Someone with an ice stone who died here…

03:50.897 --> 03:53.358
This body must belong
to that mage of the Choi family.

03:54.192 --> 03:57.487
That mage held deep resentment
toward Jin Seol-ran.

03:57.570 --> 04:00.156
You were likely attacked as it sensed
that you were her descendant.

04:00.657 --> 04:01.491
It seems so.

04:01.574 --> 04:05.328
The wraith must have noticed
that this body belongs to the Jin family.

04:08.081 --> 04:09.207
Hold on.

04:10.208 --> 04:12.585
- How did you two find me?
- I thought you summoned us.

04:12.669 --> 04:13.544
What do you mean?

04:14.587 --> 04:15.797
- I summoned you?
- Yes.

04:15.880 --> 04:18.549
I went to tell Jang Uk about this
after you had entered Gwido.

04:18.633 --> 04:20.802
You summoned us here,
so we came to your rescue.

04:20.885 --> 04:23.263
After you and Jin Mu
agreed to throw me in here,

04:23.346 --> 04:24.347
you came to rescue me?

04:24.931 --> 04:26.933
Does that mean
you went all the way to North Fortress

04:27.016 --> 04:28.476
to tell him about me?

04:30.103 --> 04:30.937
I was never

04:32.063 --> 04:33.314
at North Fortress to begin with.

04:35.441 --> 04:37.110
I never sided with Jin Mu either.

04:38.111 --> 04:39.445
I am on his side.

04:42.115 --> 04:43.950
You do not need to come so close.

04:44.951 --> 04:45.785
Stay still.

04:47.203 --> 04:48.955
I offered to join hands first

04:49.038 --> 04:50.290
since I am the Crown Prince.

04:54.043 --> 04:56.129
I will hide behind Jin Mu like you said,

04:56.212 --> 04:57.755
and I order you to go far away.

04:59.799 --> 05:00.967
It sounds like

05:01.050 --> 05:03.970
you and Jin Mu can only begin
your scheme once I leave.

05:04.053 --> 05:04.887
That is right.

05:05.680 --> 05:09.350
I will remain here
and uncover those behind his power.

05:09.434 --> 05:10.768
His secret organization?

05:10.852 --> 05:13.688
He has made countless soul shifters
with the Soul Ejector,

05:13.771 --> 05:15.523
and they are still aiding him.

05:16.107 --> 05:18.901
I do not know how many there are
or their identities.

05:18.985 --> 05:23.614
But I know that they need the ice stone
to prevent themselves from running wild.

05:23.698 --> 05:25.491
We need to wipe out
his entire secret organization

05:26.159 --> 05:27.744
if we want to stop him.

05:27.827 --> 05:30.830
And you are the only one
who can do just that.

05:32.248 --> 05:33.082
Are you saying

05:33.958 --> 05:35.626
that you want to join hands with me?

05:40.089 --> 05:41.924
Tell them you will go to North Fortress.

05:42.008 --> 05:43.885
Then return immediately.

05:43.968 --> 05:46.137
Meanwhile, I will gather
all the soul shifters

05:46.220 --> 05:48.639
in one place so you can annihilate them.

05:50.641 --> 05:53.811
You could gain great power
if you side with Jin Mu.

05:55.104 --> 05:57.106
So why have you decided to go against him?

06:02.570 --> 06:04.447
He got rid of my turtle.

06:07.283 --> 06:08.117
Your turtle?

06:08.201 --> 06:10.620
I am not going to add
a grand pretext for my decision,

06:10.703 --> 06:12.455
such as wanting to save the world.

06:12.538 --> 06:14.540
The moment he got rid of my turtle,

06:16.959 --> 06:18.628
I decided to abandon him as well.

06:23.216 --> 06:24.050
What is it?

06:25.176 --> 06:27.095
Is my trivial reason too unbelievable?

06:27.178 --> 06:30.348
You have decided to go against him
because of a single turtle.

06:30.431 --> 06:32.809
That sounds more believable
than a grand justification.

06:35.186 --> 06:37.188
So did you find your turtle?

06:43.361 --> 06:45.029
It is nowhere to be found.

06:45.113 --> 06:46.614
It is a smart turtle,

06:46.697 --> 06:48.616
so it should be able to find its way back.

06:50.618 --> 06:52.161
It may have died.

07:06.384 --> 07:08.094
Jang Uk of the Jang family

07:08.678 --> 07:10.888
will be appointed
as the general of North Fortress.

07:10.972 --> 07:14.350
No one will know
that you did not leave for the time being.

07:15.101 --> 07:17.186
I have sent one of my men
to get on that boat.

07:17.270 --> 07:21.399
So no one will know that you are missing
until the boat arrives at its destination.

07:22.275 --> 07:25.236
Stay here and wait
for Jin Mu to make his move.

07:26.195 --> 07:28.114
Dang-gu and Yul
will take turns and stop by.

07:28.197 --> 07:31.367
Could you not have found
a cleaner place for me to stay in?

07:31.451 --> 07:32.326
Look at this place.

07:32.410 --> 07:34.495
- There are so many spiderwebs.
- My goodness.

07:35.538 --> 07:38.916
He does not seem
to like this place either.

07:39.000 --> 07:41.544
- There are still spiderwebs here.
- Please be careful, Your Royal Highness.

07:41.627 --> 07:43.129
How am I to go through them?

07:43.713 --> 07:44.547
Goodness.

07:44.630 --> 07:48.134
I thought you did not like
how he was slowly crawling toward you.

07:49.177 --> 07:50.344
But I guess you opened your heart.

07:50.428 --> 07:53.097
He did not want us
to be hostile toward each other anymore.

07:53.681 --> 07:56.309
So I told him to stop bugging me
and to step aside.

07:57.018 --> 07:57.894
Goodness.

08:04.066 --> 08:07.069
I want Songrim
to give full support to Jang Uk.

08:08.404 --> 08:09.322
As for me,

08:09.947 --> 08:11.449
I will hide and make way for us.

08:15.828 --> 08:18.456
Bring them in with the gifts for the King
that get imported from the volcano.

08:18.539 --> 08:22.710
Jin Mu's items will be brought in
alongside the gifts for the King.

08:22.793 --> 08:24.712
Do not inspect them and just let them in.

08:24.795 --> 08:26.130
- Yes, my lord.
- We need to place them

08:26.214 --> 08:27.965
throughout the canals before the rite.

08:29.050 --> 08:31.344
Will you allow me to do that,
Your Royal Highness?

08:31.427 --> 08:34.388
I will inform the men of the Night Watch
who guard the city at night.

08:34.472 --> 08:35.306
You may use them.

08:36.098 --> 08:39.018
These are the areas where the Night Watch
placed the earthenware.

08:39.101 --> 08:42.396
We can retrieve the earthenware
from those places later.

08:43.064 --> 08:45.107
The earthenware will help the fire bird

08:45.191 --> 08:47.527
become stronger once it awakens.

08:48.194 --> 08:50.530
It is similar to adding fuel to a fire.

08:52.031 --> 08:55.159
Once the Unanimous Assembly begins,
Jin Mu will go for Jinyowon.

08:55.243 --> 08:56.494
And I will help him.

08:56.577 --> 08:59.830
Once he gains Jinyowon,
he will try to bring out the fire bird.

08:59.914 --> 09:03.251
His secret organization will get to work
within the next few days.

09:04.710 --> 09:07.463
Is Bu-yeon staying in Jinyowon right now?

09:08.256 --> 09:10.675
Does she know that you are here?

09:11.342 --> 09:12.510
No, I did not tell her.

09:13.094 --> 09:14.387
I see.

09:14.470 --> 09:17.431
If she finds out that you left
for North Fortress without her,

09:18.182 --> 09:19.392
she will be hurt.

09:20.935 --> 09:21.769
Right.

09:27.483 --> 09:29.110
You did not tell the shaman?

09:29.860 --> 09:30.695
Why not?

09:31.279 --> 09:32.947
She is not a shaman, Eunuch Go.

09:33.030 --> 09:33.990
Did you two fight?

09:35.283 --> 09:36.909
That was why you could not tell her.

09:36.993 --> 09:38.119
Goodness.

09:38.953 --> 09:39.787
Why?

09:40.288 --> 09:41.122
Why did you argue?

09:41.205 --> 09:44.166
She told me a few things
about your relationship

09:44.792 --> 09:46.877
during my eunuch days.

09:47.545 --> 09:48.379
So tell me.

09:50.798 --> 09:51.632
Did she

09:52.508 --> 09:53.676
mention me often?

09:53.759 --> 09:57.013
She talked about you all the time.
She was heartbroken because of you.

09:57.096 --> 09:59.181
How ridiculous.
That is rich coming from her.

10:00.600 --> 10:01.475
What is it?

10:01.559 --> 10:03.352
Did she break your heart this time?

10:03.894 --> 10:05.271
Did she cheat on you as well?

10:08.024 --> 10:08.858
Seriously?

10:08.941 --> 10:11.944
I was just joking.
Has she really fallen for someone new?

10:12.028 --> 10:14.030
He is not new.

10:14.113 --> 10:15.531
Then a former lover.

10:15.615 --> 10:17.116
So? Did she go to him?

10:17.199 --> 10:18.492
No, she did not.

10:19.368 --> 10:21.746
He does not recognize her,
and she cannot go to him.

10:23.414 --> 10:24.373
Is that so?

10:25.458 --> 10:26.709
That must mean he is…

10:28.294 --> 10:29.712
- married.
- Married?

10:31.255 --> 10:32.089
Married?

10:32.173 --> 10:34.467
That must be why he is ignoring

10:34.550 --> 10:35.885
and rejecting her.

10:36.844 --> 10:38.012
Darn it.

10:38.095 --> 10:41.265
Seeing how he is not giving in,
he must be a good man.

10:41.349 --> 10:42.975
She is the dangerous one.

10:43.643 --> 10:46.437
She is ready to abandon you
and act like a moth to a flame.

10:46.520 --> 10:47.647
She is not a moth.

10:48.689 --> 10:50.399
And she has not abandoned me yet.

10:50.483 --> 10:51.359
Yet?

10:51.442 --> 10:53.944
Does that mean you expect her
to abandon you in the future?

10:54.028 --> 10:55.613
Darn it.

10:56.781 --> 10:59.033
I should not be making a joke out of this.

10:59.116 --> 11:00.701
So please…

11:01.327 --> 11:03.454
Please stop confusing me

11:03.537 --> 11:06.290
by saying the guy is married
or that she is a moth.

11:06.374 --> 11:09.835
Despite owning an ice stone
and reaching Hwansu,

11:09.919 --> 11:12.088
you have failed to win your wife's heart.

11:12.713 --> 11:14.548
That power of yours is useless.

11:19.804 --> 11:22.848
Despite your frustration,
you cannot see her due to this situation.

11:22.932 --> 11:26.143
I will meet with her myself
and ask her what is going on.

11:26.227 --> 11:27.144
Stay here.

11:33.025 --> 11:34.110
A married man?

11:36.112 --> 11:37.363
Darn it.

11:42.576 --> 11:44.870
There is no way I can bring up that topic

11:44.954 --> 11:46.539
in a situation like this.

11:48.499 --> 11:50.668
If I stop Jin Mu right now,

11:51.377 --> 11:53.129
everything will fall apart.

11:55.631 --> 11:58.467
This is our chance to attack Jinyowon.

11:58.551 --> 12:01.929
The plaque is missing,
and Bu-yeon is trapped in Gwido.

12:02.012 --> 12:05.641
In addition, Jin Ho-gyeong
is too weak to protect her.

12:05.724 --> 12:07.268
Will you make your move right away?

12:09.019 --> 12:12.398
I promised to introduce you
to the secret organization.

12:12.982 --> 12:14.442
We will gather together tonight

12:15.192 --> 12:16.944
and open Jinyowon's doors.

12:20.573 --> 12:22.199
Tonight?

12:22.283 --> 12:23.951
Tonight?

12:24.034 --> 12:25.661
It is sooner than expected.

12:25.744 --> 12:27.121
Please inform Songrim as well.

12:27.204 --> 12:29.123
But there is one problem.

12:30.249 --> 12:32.418
Jin Bu-yeon is locked
in Cheonbugwan's prison.

12:34.628 --> 12:35.713
What prison?

12:36.714 --> 12:39.175
Gwido, the prison that holds those
who once performed sorcery.

12:39.800 --> 12:41.343
She is in there right now.

12:45.639 --> 12:48.100
If you want me
to open Gwido's door right away,

12:48.184 --> 12:49.226
I will do so.

12:49.310 --> 12:50.227
However,

12:50.811 --> 12:52.354
if I side with Jinyowon now,

12:52.438 --> 12:54.523
Jin Mu's organization
will not gather tonight,

12:54.607 --> 12:56.692
and Jin Mu will no longer trust me.

12:57.985 --> 12:58.986
What will you do?

12:59.069 --> 13:00.446
I will do as you say.

13:28.307 --> 13:30.267
I must go inside Gwido.

13:30.935 --> 13:33.854
Please feign ignorance
and step aside, Your Royal Highness.

13:44.949 --> 13:45.950
Jang Uk.

13:46.033 --> 13:46.992
It is a turtle.

13:49.745 --> 13:50.871
That is my turtle.

13:51.455 --> 13:54.500
She took that turtle with her into Gwido.

13:55.125 --> 13:56.085
Hey, turtle.

13:56.585 --> 13:57.920
How did you get out of there?

14:08.013 --> 14:10.099
Jang Uk, come here.

14:12.893 --> 14:14.562
That is the door to Gwido.

14:14.645 --> 14:16.105
But why is it here?

14:17.189 --> 14:18.148
Did you come out of there?

14:19.858 --> 14:22.861
Someone opened the door here.

14:23.571 --> 14:26.866
They must want us to go in there.

14:27.741 --> 14:28.701
Who?

14:29.618 --> 14:31.704
Turtle, was it you?

14:32.288 --> 14:34.081
The person who summoned us…

14:36.417 --> 14:38.168
must be the one who is inside.

14:41.297 --> 14:43.549
Bu-yeon must have summoned Uk
with her divine powers.

14:45.718 --> 14:49.471
She must have opened the door
to protect herself.

14:49.555 --> 14:50.973
Was it not you?

14:51.557 --> 14:54.018
That is correct. Bu-yeon opened it.

14:54.602 --> 14:55.853
You have incredible divine powers.

14:55.936 --> 14:57.980
With such powers,
you could have cast away the wraith.

14:58.063 --> 15:00.274
Why did you open the door
and summon Jang Uk?

15:01.901 --> 15:02.735
You are right.

15:02.818 --> 15:04.695
I should not have done that.

15:05.279 --> 15:06.822
In the end, he saw something…

15:09.408 --> 15:10.409
he should not have.

15:22.755 --> 15:25.257
The ice stone in Jang Uk's body

15:25.341 --> 15:28.844
was left behind by Master Seo Gyeong
to save Jin Seol-ran.

15:28.928 --> 15:30.888
But she passed away.

15:31.597 --> 15:34.516
So why do you think
he still left it in Jinyowon?

15:35.100 --> 15:36.727
He could have just destroyed it.

15:37.394 --> 15:39.104
What do you wish to say?

15:40.689 --> 15:42.524
I heard you first took out the ice stone

15:42.608 --> 15:45.527
to use it to save
your unborn baby that had died.

15:46.278 --> 15:48.572
And that baby grew up to be Jin Bu-yeon.

15:49.740 --> 15:52.660
If Jin Seol-ran's soul
remained in the ice stone,

15:52.743 --> 15:54.495
I thought maybe the baby you had saved

15:54.578 --> 15:57.831
could have been Jin Seol-ran herself.

16:00.584 --> 16:02.878
Bu-yeon was blind from birth
just like Jin Seol-ran

16:02.962 --> 16:05.130
and possessed astounding divine powers.

16:05.214 --> 16:06.548
Have you never

16:07.925 --> 16:09.301
found that odd?

16:10.678 --> 16:13.222
How is that relevant
when I gave birth and raised her myself?

16:16.183 --> 16:20.396
If Bu-yeon possesses divine powers
similar to Jin Seol-ran's,

16:20.479 --> 16:23.357
she will make it out of Gwido.

16:24.024 --> 16:29.196
Perhaps Naksu willingly went there,
hoping to retrieve her divine powers.

16:31.031 --> 16:32.074
Has she decided

16:33.117 --> 16:35.285
to disappear in Gwido?

16:51.927 --> 16:54.221
I looked around and found no threats.

16:55.180 --> 16:57.766
But this place is quite big.

16:57.850 --> 16:59.768
Do you think
you can find the plaque alone?

17:01.270 --> 17:03.981
This body will find it with divine powers
equal to Jin Seol-ran's.

17:06.316 --> 17:09.194
Jang Uk tried to look for you
with his red jade.

17:11.113 --> 17:12.656
Do you have the blue one?

17:19.830 --> 17:21.498
Did he call me through this?

17:23.083 --> 17:24.168
I did not know.

17:25.127 --> 17:27.087
Did he give that to you?

17:29.590 --> 17:30.799
That is not yours.

17:31.884 --> 17:33.052
That belongs to someone else.

17:35.137 --> 17:35.971
I know.

17:37.222 --> 17:39.099
He temporarily left it with me

17:40.726 --> 17:42.102
so I could read her memories.

17:43.687 --> 17:45.022
You even have that kind of power?

17:45.606 --> 17:48.025
You are indeed not a shaman,
but a powerful priestess.

17:50.319 --> 17:51.153
Give it to me.

17:52.362 --> 17:54.198
It is not yours,
so I will return it to him.

17:59.661 --> 18:00.662
In the past,

18:02.581 --> 18:03.957
you also tried to take it.

18:06.251 --> 18:07.086
I gave it back.

18:07.169 --> 18:08.295
Do not lie.

18:10.589 --> 18:12.091
She picked it up after you threw it away.

18:13.217 --> 18:14.551
You know one too many things.

18:19.723 --> 18:20.849
She must remember me

18:22.392 --> 18:24.269
as someone who is heinous.

18:25.270 --> 18:26.230
She always wished

18:27.648 --> 18:30.651
you were Jang Uk's ally

18:32.569 --> 18:33.487
and not his enemy.

18:36.073 --> 18:37.741
I am sure she is happy to see…

18:39.660 --> 18:40.828
that you are helping him.

18:42.830 --> 18:45.040
Whenever I showed
my pettiness in front of her,

18:46.375 --> 18:48.043
she bad-mouthed whomever I disliked.

18:49.711 --> 18:50.587
Despite it all,

18:50.671 --> 18:54.174
it was annoying and impressive to see
that she always sided with her master.

18:56.635 --> 18:57.761
That is why I liked her.

18:59.346 --> 19:00.806
She deceived you…

19:03.934 --> 19:05.310
all along, Your Royal Highness.

19:07.271 --> 19:08.188
I am aware of that.

19:10.816 --> 19:12.776
So when she died,

19:13.819 --> 19:16.321
I thought I would quickly forget about her
since she deceived me.

19:18.073 --> 19:18.907
However,

19:20.951 --> 19:22.452
that never happened.

19:27.082 --> 19:29.626
I wanted to have her.

19:31.086 --> 19:33.213
My graceless desire to destroy something

19:35.048 --> 19:36.383
that I could not have

19:36.884 --> 19:39.887
definitely played a part in my decision
to turn my back on Jang Uk.

19:41.263 --> 19:42.931
That is why whenever I think of her,

19:43.515 --> 19:46.935
I feel ashamed of myself,
and I feel painful remorse.

19:47.728 --> 19:49.688
If she knows that you are in pain…

19:53.025 --> 19:54.401
she will probably

19:55.319 --> 19:56.445
be content with that.

19:57.738 --> 19:58.697
You are right.

20:00.240 --> 20:02.868
She is not someone
who would tell me to stop being in pain.

20:04.536 --> 20:07.623
If it is possible,
I would like her to know

20:09.333 --> 20:10.959
that I am in…

20:12.878 --> 20:14.296
an inexplicable amount of pain.

20:17.132 --> 20:18.050
Still…

20:20.594 --> 20:22.304
she would not want the pain to last.

20:25.474 --> 20:27.100
After you have been in enough pain…

20:29.978 --> 20:30.812
you should let go.

20:46.954 --> 20:49.706
I found it in So-i's belongings
during her funeral.

20:50.874 --> 20:53.043
The potion looked strange,
so I brought it here.

20:53.627 --> 20:56.505
This is a soul potion
that is used in sorcery.

20:57.089 --> 20:59.299
It is a heinous and bewitching potion

20:59.383 --> 21:01.677
that helps divination.

21:02.386 --> 21:03.512
Master Heo.

21:03.595 --> 21:07.683
Was not the Queen, who had been
locked up after shifting souls,

21:07.766 --> 21:10.519
fed this potion?

21:10.602 --> 21:11.436
You are right.

21:12.020 --> 21:13.981
Shaman Choi concocted this.

21:14.773 --> 21:16.566
How did So-i have this?

21:17.150 --> 21:18.068
Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan

21:19.152 --> 21:21.238
had something on her and was using her.

21:23.907 --> 21:25.534
It could be from Cheonbugwan.

21:25.617 --> 21:26.535
I will look into it.

21:30.539 --> 21:32.332
It must be that potion.

21:32.416 --> 21:35.669
Madam So-i and Yeom-su,
a Cheonbugwan mage,

21:36.253 --> 21:38.588
would feed it to others
once or twice a month.

21:39.256 --> 21:41.425
She called it the bell potion.

21:41.508 --> 21:42.342
The bell potion?

21:42.926 --> 21:46.763
She said you would hear bells
and go insane if you consume it.

21:50.267 --> 21:52.227
Do you know where and on whom she used it?

21:52.311 --> 21:53.520
No, I do not.

21:53.603 --> 21:56.440
She rarely told me anything related
to Cheonbugwan since it was dangerous.

21:58.984 --> 22:02.279
But she once mentioned
an individual who consumed it.

22:09.328 --> 22:15.042
I rarely feel guilty for the things
I have done in my life.

22:15.125 --> 22:16.793
But one thing bothers me.

22:17.836 --> 22:19.629
There is one person I feel bad for.

22:21.548 --> 22:23.467
That person was very kind

22:24.343 --> 22:26.219
and treated me well.

22:26.303 --> 22:28.096
It must have been a guy.

22:28.180 --> 22:29.264
You are wrong.

22:29.848 --> 22:32.142
She was a girl I had met in Sari Village.

22:34.811 --> 22:37.314
Had I not stolen what was hers,

22:37.397 --> 22:39.775
she would have found
her parents right away.

22:41.943 --> 22:44.696
Then she would not
have gone crazy and died.

22:44.780 --> 22:45.864
Gone crazy and died?

22:45.947 --> 22:48.533
She was also a victim of the bell potion.

22:50.327 --> 22:52.120
So a girl she met in Sari Village

22:53.747 --> 22:55.499
consumed this same potion?

22:56.291 --> 22:57.292
Yes.

23:01.296 --> 23:04.174
You ignored me just like your father did
and never visited me once.

23:04.257 --> 23:07.219
And now, you barge in here
and demand to know about the soul potion?

23:07.302 --> 23:10.347
I heard you were force-fed
that potion when you were locked up.

23:10.430 --> 23:11.598
Did you perhaps

23:12.182 --> 23:14.518
hear the sound of bells during that time?

23:21.942 --> 23:24.653
I do not want to relive those moments.
That is enough.

23:24.736 --> 23:25.695
This is important.

23:26.279 --> 23:30.075
Someone seems to still be controlling
the soul shifters with this potion.

23:30.158 --> 23:31.952
Shaman Choi, her brother, and Jang Gang

23:32.035 --> 23:33.662
turned her into a soul shifter.

23:34.246 --> 23:36.748
They are all dead, so please do not
torment Her Highness anymore.

23:37.707 --> 23:40.168
The potion may have altered your memory,
Your Highness.

23:40.252 --> 23:41.753
Please try to remember.

23:41.837 --> 23:43.213
I know it may be painful,

23:43.922 --> 23:45.298
but please try to remember.

23:45.382 --> 23:46.633
I said that was enough!

23:46.716 --> 23:48.802
I am still in pain.

23:48.885 --> 23:52.139
You do not deserve to ask for my help
when you cannot take away this pain.

23:52.222 --> 23:55.642
We are trying to end the alchemy of souls,
which is the root of your pain.

23:55.725 --> 23:57.310
I do not want it to end.

23:57.894 --> 24:00.313
I do not understand why it is forbidden.

24:00.397 --> 24:04.693
I, the Queen, want to take
a young, insignificant body.

24:04.776 --> 24:05.694
Why is that wrong?

24:09.781 --> 24:11.616
You almost died recently, Yul.

24:11.700 --> 24:13.118
If the alchemy of souls is permitted,

24:13.201 --> 24:16.121
the precious son of the Seo family
will never worry about dying.

24:16.204 --> 24:20.041
And you will be able to stay powerful
forever as the great leader of Songrim.

24:20.667 --> 24:22.210
Do you not want that?

24:22.294 --> 24:23.545
If someone powerful

24:24.880 --> 24:27.507
has everything they want and is immortal,

24:28.466 --> 24:29.968
what will become of this world?

24:31.094 --> 24:33.680
Rain is necessary,
but it should not last forever.

24:33.763 --> 24:36.766
The sun is also necessary,
but it should set as well.

24:36.850 --> 24:37.851
And no one

24:39.186 --> 24:43.023
should stay powerful and live forever.

24:47.652 --> 24:50.947
That hypocrisy is
what makes everyone uncomfortable.

24:51.031 --> 24:53.867
What do you think
other powerful individuals think?

24:53.950 --> 24:58.163
We all want to join hands with the one
who will grant us everlasting power.

24:58.246 --> 24:59.748
That is the truth.

24:59.831 --> 25:01.917
And is that individual

25:02.792 --> 25:03.627
Jin Mu?

25:03.710 --> 25:05.503
- What?
- Please calm down, Your Highness.

25:05.587 --> 25:08.673
Her Highness is very distressed.
You should all leave.

25:13.303 --> 25:16.473
Jin Mu controlled the soul shifters
with his divination.

25:16.556 --> 25:18.016
Perhaps Naksu

25:19.643 --> 25:21.728
was also one of his victims.

25:22.562 --> 25:26.775
Even so, that does not change the fact
that she practiced the alchemy of souls.

25:26.858 --> 25:30.320
Still, I would like
to reveal the truth and lessen her burden

25:30.403 --> 25:32.906
regarding the tragedy three years ago.

25:33.865 --> 25:38.036
Even Uk is in pain
as he is paying the price because of her.

25:38.119 --> 25:39.871
Do you think he is in pain

25:40.705 --> 25:44.167
solely because he is taking responsibility
for Naksu's sins?

25:45.085 --> 25:46.670
Do you remember what the Queen said today?

25:46.753 --> 25:49.631
She did not see the fault
in powerful individuals

25:49.714 --> 25:51.007
gaining everlasting power.

25:52.884 --> 25:55.011
Uk already possesses that power.

25:55.679 --> 25:57.806
What troubles him the most

25:57.889 --> 26:00.100
is that he must take responsibility

26:01.059 --> 26:04.354
as someone who possesses the power
that Jin Mu and the Queen desire.

26:05.146 --> 26:07.649
Depending on who Uk's target is
and which path he takes,

26:09.442 --> 26:12.529
he could dry out this world,
just like Jin Mu wishes.

26:13.989 --> 26:15.532
Or he could stop him.

26:20.912 --> 26:22.664
Deciding whom to target

26:23.540 --> 26:25.458
and which path to take

26:26.459 --> 26:28.712
will always be painful and a burden.

26:29.379 --> 26:33.091
It may be too much for a human to handle.

26:42.017 --> 26:43.435
I saved her life

26:43.977 --> 26:44.936
and took care of her.

26:45.812 --> 26:48.356
You have taken what Jin Ho-gyeong

26:48.982 --> 26:51.067
has tried so hard to hide.

26:52.444 --> 26:56.865
Master Lee must have known
that there was another soul within her.

26:58.199 --> 26:59.034
He recognized it

27:00.368 --> 27:02.203
and feigned ignorance once again.

27:08.209 --> 27:09.294
The same blue mark.

27:09.377 --> 27:12.922
There was a huge tree
where I used to live.

27:13.006 --> 27:16.760
So I imagined myself sitting alone
on top of a tall tree.

27:17.594 --> 27:18.845
The same memory.

27:24.225 --> 27:26.227
Just die if you are not
going to do anything.

27:26.811 --> 27:28.938
It is better to die than do nothing.

27:31.691 --> 27:33.610
Are they the same person?

27:45.455 --> 27:47.082
We found our way here thanks to it.

27:47.665 --> 27:51.169
It could help you find the plaque,
so keep it with you.

27:51.795 --> 27:53.380
I will leave first.

27:53.463 --> 27:55.298
Talk it out with Uk before he leaves.

27:56.591 --> 27:57.801
You should also reconcile.

27:58.718 --> 28:00.053
He will be…

28:01.971 --> 28:03.348
in a huge battle today.

28:03.431 --> 28:06.810
Jin Mu's secret organization
will gather to attack Jinyowon.

28:06.893 --> 28:08.853
And Uk will annihilate
all of the soul shifters.

28:09.437 --> 28:12.899
We do not know their number
or how strong they are.

28:13.441 --> 28:16.945
However, we must wipe out
every single one of them who is in hiding

28:17.779 --> 28:20.407
to put an end
to Jin Mu's everlasting greed.

28:20.490 --> 28:23.660
And Jang Uk is the only one
who is capable of doing that.

28:23.743 --> 28:26.037
All of them will have to be
eradicated for this to end.

28:28.331 --> 28:29.916
Every single one of them.

28:37.674 --> 28:39.175
The Crown Prince left first.

28:39.259 --> 28:40.510
We are now…

28:42.804 --> 28:43.805
the only ones here.

28:47.559 --> 28:48.393
All right.

28:49.018 --> 28:50.353
You can ask what you are curious about.

28:50.437 --> 28:51.396
No.

28:53.106 --> 28:53.940
I will not.

28:54.733 --> 28:58.069
So you better not say a word
before I respond.

29:01.906 --> 29:03.825
The war that I am about to start

29:05.034 --> 29:06.619
is clearly and precisely right.

29:07.245 --> 29:09.289
I am doing what I can to stop them

29:10.790 --> 29:12.417
from doing what they should not do.

29:14.419 --> 29:17.797
Some will try to condone it
with a believable justification.

29:17.881 --> 29:20.467
Others will come up
with countless excuses to stop me.

29:21.384 --> 29:24.137
But this fight is the right thing to do.

29:24.220 --> 29:26.723
That is why I know
exactly whom to point my sword at

29:28.641 --> 29:30.059
and I know which path to take.

29:30.935 --> 29:31.770
That is why

29:33.104 --> 29:34.773
I must not recognize you here.

29:37.650 --> 29:38.693
But let me ask you…

29:40.987 --> 29:42.030
something else instead.

29:45.784 --> 29:46.618
Should I…

29:48.912 --> 29:50.288
not leave here?

29:52.373 --> 29:53.792
Should I do absolutely nothing…

29:57.670 --> 29:58.880
and stay here with you?

30:11.893 --> 30:12.852
Should we do that?

30:15.897 --> 30:17.857
I can probably close Gwido's door.

30:18.650 --> 30:19.484
Then should we…

30:21.486 --> 30:22.779
stay here together?

30:28.952 --> 30:29.994
But the answer is…

30:33.373 --> 30:35.583
that such a decision
would clearly and precisely be wrong.

30:36.876 --> 30:39.045
No matter the justification or excuse.

30:40.046 --> 30:41.130
Even if…

30:45.760 --> 30:47.512
we were deeply pining and longing…

30:50.682 --> 30:51.683
for each other.

31:08.199 --> 31:09.659
Dang-gu, go to Jinyowon.

31:09.742 --> 31:11.286
Inform everyone and defend it.

31:12.120 --> 31:14.289
- Yes, my lord.
- Yul and Sang-ho.

31:14.372 --> 31:15.957
Once everyone is gathered
in the secret room,

31:16.040 --> 31:19.919
go to Cheonbugwan and stop the officials
who are outside the secret room.

31:20.003 --> 31:21.129
- Yes, my lord.
- Yes, my lord.

31:21.921 --> 31:23.047
Once the battle begins,

31:23.131 --> 31:25.884
I will go to the palace
and meet with the King.

31:25.967 --> 31:28.720
I thought Jang Uk
had gone to North Fortress.

31:29.304 --> 31:32.307
But he is going up against Jin Mu
alongside the Crown Prince.

31:32.390 --> 31:36.269
He has decided to undertake
a great responsibility.

31:38.187 --> 31:39.355
Please keep him safe.

31:40.523 --> 31:41.649
Be safe as well.

31:44.777 --> 31:47.572
Once the sun sets,
Jin Mu's gathering will begin.

31:48.156 --> 31:50.074
Once this night passes without problems,

31:50.158 --> 31:54.621
the world they wish to see
will never come.

32:03.671 --> 32:06.883
We will bring back the sky
from that fateful day 200 years ago.

32:07.967 --> 32:09.469
The world will dry up.

32:09.552 --> 32:11.429
And when we perform the rite,

32:12.305 --> 32:17.060
the ice stone, full of energy of the sky,
will fall into our hands.

32:17.769 --> 32:20.980
We will live in a world
where the strong gain greater power

32:22.565 --> 32:25.526
and continue to rule forever!

32:32.617 --> 32:34.869
Are you saying they are all soul shifters?

32:34.953 --> 32:37.246
Those who wished for youth
received younger bodies.

32:37.330 --> 32:40.166
Those who wished for power
received the bodies of the powerful.

32:40.249 --> 32:44.796
And those who wished for beauty
received alluring, beautiful bodies.

32:44.879 --> 32:46.381
They all fulfilled their desires

32:47.715 --> 32:49.175
through soul shifting.

32:49.968 --> 32:51.970
They may be in hiding for now.

32:53.846 --> 32:56.057
But once the door to the new world opens,

32:56.140 --> 32:59.477
they will be of great use to you,
Your Royal Highness.

32:59.560 --> 33:00.395
Gwanju.

33:03.147 --> 33:05.149
When that new world emerges,

33:08.194 --> 33:10.363
what will become of those
who lose their bodies?

33:11.030 --> 33:12.490
The young will age,

33:12.573 --> 33:16.744
the powerful will lose their position,
and the beautiful will become ugly.

33:16.828 --> 33:17.745
Your Royal Highness.

33:18.955 --> 33:23.918
Did I not tell you not to allow yourself
to cling to something so insignificant?

33:26.629 --> 33:29.882
I do not think that trying to protect
such things is a sign of weakness.

33:32.093 --> 33:33.761
Rather, it is a sign of strength.

33:34.345 --> 33:38.599
And I am about to show you
exactly how powerful that strength is.

34:16.471 --> 34:18.347
You have deceived me.

34:18.431 --> 34:21.517
No, you just underestimated me
and thought I was weak.

34:21.601 --> 34:24.145
I did everything for you.

34:25.396 --> 34:28.524
And yet, are you going to abandon me?

34:28.608 --> 34:32.111
That is not how I would describe
an enemy whom I am about to confront.

34:34.030 --> 34:36.991
I am here to fight against you
alongside Jang Uk!

34:43.664 --> 34:44.874
Jang Uk?

35:04.685 --> 35:05.520
Attack!

35:47.145 --> 35:49.105
There is a barrier around the secret room.

36:03.077 --> 36:03.911
Jang Uk.

36:04.704 --> 36:05.872
You are here.

37:17.777 --> 37:19.237
There is no need to be alarmed.

37:19.320 --> 37:20.947
I have only created a barrier.

37:21.739 --> 37:25.451
But this one is much more complicated
than the one you had locked me in before.

37:29.497 --> 37:34.418
I must say, I am quite busy
fighting all 78 soul shifters as we speak.

38:18.796 --> 38:20.006
Funnily enough, only you,

38:20.089 --> 38:22.341
the head of this secret organization,
are not a soul shifter.

38:23.009 --> 38:24.468
Were you afraid of running wild?

38:24.552 --> 38:28.180
Then why did you encourage others
to do something so harmful?

38:29.932 --> 38:32.184
So you are finally here
to take your revenge.

38:32.268 --> 38:34.103
I would not have come
to do something that meaningless.

38:36.272 --> 38:39.066
I left behind a world
that I had always pined for.

38:39.859 --> 38:40.860
Do you really think

38:41.861 --> 38:43.571
I left that world solely to kill you?

38:44.947 --> 38:47.241
What you are doing is absolutely wrong,

38:48.159 --> 38:50.244
and it is absolutely right
for me to stop you.

38:51.579 --> 38:53.289
So I am here to do what I need to do.

38:57.084 --> 38:58.919
It is true that I vehemently resent you.

38:59.920 --> 39:01.630
But that revenge is not mine to take.

39:03.632 --> 39:04.467
Go.

39:28.532 --> 39:29.950
Go do what you can.

39:30.034 --> 39:31.285
And I will stay here…

39:33.496 --> 39:34.705
and do what I can.

39:36.290 --> 39:37.541
Send Jin Mu here.

39:44.799 --> 39:45.883
Why am I here?

39:52.139 --> 39:53.182
The ice stone?

40:15.788 --> 40:17.665
I definitely saw an ice stone.

40:18.916 --> 40:21.460
Has there been one here as well?

41:00.207 --> 41:02.293
It was here as I suspected.

41:10.009 --> 41:11.093
That is an ice stone.

41:14.638 --> 41:15.723
Right.

41:16.682 --> 41:18.309
I forgot that you were here.

41:18.893 --> 41:20.102
Jin Bu-yeon.

41:21.353 --> 41:22.855
Did you find this?

41:23.731 --> 41:27.359
Yes, just like how I found one
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

41:28.527 --> 41:30.154
I thought you had lost your memory.

41:31.780 --> 41:35.826
Anyway, I am impressed
that you found it once again.

41:35.910 --> 41:37.203
You can have it.

41:38.287 --> 41:39.121
It is yours.

41:39.205 --> 41:41.290
The ice stone possesses
the energy of the sky.

41:41.916 --> 41:44.376
Only the chosen ones
can possess its power.

41:44.460 --> 41:47.671
Jang Gang and that mage of the Choi family
were able to use its power.

41:47.755 --> 41:51.509
But they could not possess it
as their own like Jang Uk has.

41:51.592 --> 41:53.093
Shall I help you?

41:54.678 --> 41:55.513
You?

42:01.101 --> 42:02.228
That is right.

42:04.772 --> 42:09.151
You are a priestess comparable
to Jin Seol-ran, Seo Gyeong's lover.

42:11.737 --> 42:12.571
All right.

42:13.948 --> 42:14.782
Go on.

42:15.533 --> 42:16.367
I will

42:17.660 --> 42:19.411
make that yours.

42:55.030 --> 42:56.615
What is happening to me?

42:57.783 --> 42:58.617
My energy…

42:58.701 --> 43:00.661
That ice stone is empty.

43:03.497 --> 43:05.583
It only desires to absorb energy

43:06.959 --> 43:08.794
like a soul shifter who has run wild.

43:16.802 --> 43:18.220
You will not die quickly.

43:18.304 --> 43:20.389
You will slowly wither away

43:21.348 --> 43:22.474
like a piece of wood.

43:26.061 --> 43:27.688
Just like that mage of the Choi family.

43:28.522 --> 43:29.648
Why would you…

43:32.234 --> 43:33.235
do this?

43:33.319 --> 43:35.362
You must remember my face, do you not?

43:38.198 --> 43:40.200
I guess you never thought
it could actually be me.

43:41.952 --> 43:42.828
Danju.

43:47.750 --> 43:50.085
Naksu?

43:52.171 --> 43:54.256
This prison holds those
who have performed sorcery.

44:00.179 --> 44:03.515
This is the kind of death
that suits you perfectly.

44:04.892 --> 44:06.352
Do not resent me too much.

44:09.063 --> 44:10.272
I will likely meet my end…

44:13.317 --> 44:15.277
in this place as well.

44:42.721 --> 44:43.722
Jang Uk.

44:45.766 --> 44:47.393
You have finally done it.

44:49.603 --> 44:51.063
Uk, are you all right?

44:53.232 --> 44:54.733
Your body is as cold as ice.

44:55.359 --> 44:56.193
It is bearable

44:57.403 --> 44:58.237
for now.

44:58.821 --> 44:59.947
Where is Jin Mu?

45:00.781 --> 45:01.824
I sent him to Gwido.

45:03.075 --> 45:06.036
He will meet a demise that suits him.

45:06.954 --> 45:08.455
But Bu-yeon is still in there.

45:09.373 --> 45:10.916
She asked me to send him there.

45:12.292 --> 45:15.129
She wanted to fulfill her role
in all of this.

45:23.470 --> 45:24.513
Uk.

45:36.942 --> 45:39.945
Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan has been sent
to Gwido, the prison for sorcerers.

45:40.028 --> 45:43.490
And every soul shifter in his organization
has been petrified to death.

45:43.574 --> 45:45.826
And was this done single-handedly
by Jang Uk and Songrim?

45:45.909 --> 45:47.077
Without telling anyone?

45:47.161 --> 45:49.246
Today seemed like our only opportunity,

45:50.080 --> 45:53.167
so we had no time to discuss it
with you or the Unanimous Assembly.

45:53.250 --> 45:56.170
The ice stone's power
that Jang Uk possesses sure is incredible.

45:56.753 --> 45:58.464
He, who belongs to Songrim,

45:58.547 --> 46:01.133
has gotten rid of Jin Mu, his only rival.

46:02.134 --> 46:05.637
Songrim will challenge the royal family
and the Unanimous Assembly in no time.

46:07.473 --> 46:09.683
This was not a power struggle,
Your Majesty.

46:10.476 --> 46:12.728
We only interfered
with Jin Mu's dangerous scheme

46:12.811 --> 46:15.147
of trying to steal
the fire bird from Jinyowon.

46:15.230 --> 46:16.231
Whatever it may be,

46:16.982 --> 46:19.401
everyone was forbidden
from possessing its power.

46:19.485 --> 46:22.070
But Songrim indeed is
the only one to possess it.

46:23.989 --> 46:25.741
Not everyone will be happy about this.

46:32.080 --> 46:33.207
Jin Mu is dead?

46:34.374 --> 46:36.793
Then what will become of me?

46:36.877 --> 46:38.170
Will I…

46:40.380 --> 46:43.342
be trapped in this body forever?

46:45.093 --> 46:46.512
He is trapped in Gwido.

46:47.095 --> 46:48.680
I do not think he will make it out alive.

46:56.355 --> 46:57.689
Find a way.

46:57.773 --> 47:00.025
You must find a way!

47:13.372 --> 47:15.374
Seeing how Jin Mu came here,

47:19.002 --> 47:21.463
Jang Uk and your master
must have done their job.

47:24.883 --> 47:26.468
I will remain here…

47:28.428 --> 47:29.596
until my soul disappears.

47:32.599 --> 47:34.851
Then only Jin Bu-yeon will be left
to leave this place.

47:36.979 --> 47:37.896
If that happens…

47:41.775 --> 47:44.236
I will not have to be
Jang Uk's final task.

48:00.919 --> 48:02.087
It went into the sea.

48:03.797 --> 48:06.341
But then again, you are a turtle.

48:06.425 --> 48:08.385
It is only natural that you go to the sea.

48:36.622 --> 48:38.206
This is the Jinyowon Plaque.

48:48.133 --> 48:49.760
Did you find it for me

48:51.261 --> 48:52.721
so I could leave this place?

48:55.849 --> 48:56.683
In any case,

48:57.976 --> 48:59.144
thank you.

49:10.322 --> 49:11.448
THE BLACK TORTOISE

49:11.531 --> 49:14.076
I met a sacred animal that possessed
the energy of the Black Tortoise.

49:14.868 --> 49:16.453
It was diligently crawling somewhere.

49:17.079 --> 49:18.914
It must have found a path for someone.

49:23.168 --> 49:26.046
I heard Jang Uk entered Gwido
to look for Jin Bu-yeon.

49:26.630 --> 49:30.550
Seeing how he left that place,
he must have found his path as well.

49:30.634 --> 49:33.720
After putting an end
to the difficult battle,

49:33.804 --> 49:37.474
Uk is single-handedly enduring
the consequences.

49:51.905 --> 49:54.991
He is weathering the wraiths
that are drawn by the energy of the sky.

49:55.075 --> 50:00.080
He is fighting another battle
in a cold, dark place all by himself.

50:04.668 --> 50:06.712
Why do you think he was chosen

50:07.838 --> 50:09.131
to carry this burden?

50:09.214 --> 50:12.217
Is he paying the price for being
a product of the alchemy of souls?

50:12.801 --> 50:15.929
While the most powerful
fought over the ice stone,

50:16.012 --> 50:19.766
it found its way to him.

50:21.935 --> 50:22.769
I believe

50:23.895 --> 50:25.814
she was behind it all along.

50:29.401 --> 50:31.778
She? Whom are you speaking of?

50:31.862 --> 50:34.948
The one who first received
the ice stone from Master Seo Gyeong.

50:36.241 --> 50:40.036
I believe she has remained here
and has been protecting the ice stone.

50:40.620 --> 50:43.457
Are you talking about Jin Seol-ran?

50:45.417 --> 50:50.338
It is my assumption that she chose

50:52.090 --> 50:53.341
both Jang Uk and that girl.

51:01.016 --> 51:02.225
Are you all right?

51:03.894 --> 51:04.936
I am sorry.

51:05.437 --> 51:07.773
I should have gone instead of you.

51:07.856 --> 51:09.274
I am all right.

51:10.817 --> 51:11.860
I found the plaque.

51:16.323 --> 51:17.365
You did it.

51:18.074 --> 51:20.118
You are really my daughter, Bu-yeon.

51:20.994 --> 51:21.828
I am sorry.

51:22.662 --> 51:23.997
Do not be sorry.

51:24.664 --> 51:26.625
Now that you have found it,

51:26.708 --> 51:28.168
Jinyowon will be safe.

51:29.961 --> 51:32.547
The Unanimous Assembly
will be summoned today regarding Jin Mu.

51:32.631 --> 51:34.758
You will have to explain
what happened in Gwido.

51:34.841 --> 51:35.967
Will you

51:36.968 --> 51:37.969
be able to do it?

51:38.053 --> 51:39.221
Yes, I can.

51:39.805 --> 51:42.140
I will attend the Unanimous Assembly.

51:44.851 --> 51:47.395
Seo Yul has been waiting for you.

51:47.938 --> 51:48.897
You should go see him.

51:58.532 --> 51:59.616
Uk and I…

52:03.078 --> 52:05.038
have decided to feign ignorance.

52:06.790 --> 52:09.501
I hope you will do the same.

52:12.087 --> 52:13.296
I have something to tell you.

52:14.881 --> 52:17.634
Jin Mu could control
the soul shifters with his divination.

52:18.635 --> 52:19.594
So I believe…

52:21.179 --> 52:23.390
that the tragic events in Songrim
three years ago

52:25.141 --> 52:27.769
did not occur out of Naksu's will,
but because of Jin Mu.

52:43.285 --> 52:44.911
So that was why

52:45.620 --> 52:47.247
I heard those bells.

52:57.465 --> 52:59.801
If you are blaming yourself
for what happened,

53:01.678 --> 53:04.014
I wanted to let you know
you do not need to do that.

53:09.936 --> 53:11.396
I hope this excuse…

53:14.733 --> 53:16.568
will let you stay where you want to be.

53:19.446 --> 53:22.490
I was merely a soul shifter
who was driven by vengeance.

53:23.491 --> 53:27.454
I was an assassin raised in Danhyanggok
with that one purpose.

53:28.038 --> 53:30.040
And I just simply met my demise.

53:33.084 --> 53:33.960
So that…

53:37.923 --> 53:39.549
cannot be an excuse.

53:55.273 --> 53:57.233
You are really going to North Fortress?

53:57.317 --> 53:59.110
If I remain here,

53:59.194 --> 54:02.155
people will torment Lord Park
and Songrim regarding the ice stone.

54:02.739 --> 54:04.449
I must obey the King's command

54:05.033 --> 54:06.242
for the Crown Prince's sake as well.

54:07.494 --> 54:08.578
When will you be leaving?

54:08.662 --> 54:11.831
I have been given a position there,
so I must leave right away.

54:13.208 --> 54:14.417
So I am afraid

54:15.168 --> 54:17.087
that I will not be attending your wedding.

54:17.170 --> 54:18.922
That is not the problem.

54:19.673 --> 54:22.592
You are going far away.
Who knows when we will meet again?

54:22.676 --> 54:24.928
You can visit me with Lord Park.

54:25.512 --> 54:27.764
Then how about I follow you for now--

54:27.847 --> 54:28.682
No.

54:29.265 --> 54:30.225
I said no.

54:32.227 --> 54:35.605
Do not say that to him.
He is already very jealous of me.

54:36.231 --> 54:37.524
It cannot be helped.

54:37.607 --> 54:39.734
You will always be my top priority.

54:39.818 --> 54:40.902
I know.

54:41.653 --> 54:44.155
But do not express such feelings to him.

54:47.200 --> 54:48.576
He does get sulky easily.

54:50.412 --> 54:51.413
Maidservant Kim.

54:52.747 --> 54:54.457
I may not be there for the wedding,

54:55.291 --> 54:57.252
but make sure you are
the prettiest person there.

54:58.128 --> 55:01.297
Make sure you look like
the happiest woman in the world.

55:02.924 --> 55:03.758
I will.

55:05.135 --> 55:07.012
I promise to look the prettiest

55:08.555 --> 55:09.848
and happiest.

55:29.659 --> 55:32.412
I did not know
Uk was concerned about that.

55:32.495 --> 55:36.875
Let us also move
to North Fortress after our wedding.

55:36.958 --> 55:38.710
Will you be fine with that?

55:39.252 --> 55:43.048
I am no longer the leader of Songrim.
I am free to go wherever I want.

55:43.798 --> 55:46.926
Is that why you did not attend
the Unanimous Assembly today?

55:47.594 --> 55:49.054
If I remain here,

55:49.679 --> 55:52.766
they will pester Uk
regarding the ice stone.

55:52.849 --> 55:54.976
That is exactly what he said.

55:55.643 --> 55:56.770
In that case,

55:57.353 --> 55:59.397
let us move there right after the wedding.

56:00.231 --> 56:01.900
Promise me.

56:06.905 --> 56:08.281
Hold on.

56:08.364 --> 56:10.533
Why are you wearing
the ring on your pinky?

56:11.159 --> 56:12.452
It is for this finger.

56:12.535 --> 56:14.120
It is too small.

56:15.413 --> 56:17.332
It stops my blood circulation.

56:17.916 --> 56:18.792
Is that so?

56:18.875 --> 56:19.876
Then take it off.

56:19.959 --> 56:21.544
I will make it bigger

56:21.628 --> 56:23.630
or get you a larger size.

56:25.006 --> 56:25.840
Goodness.

56:25.924 --> 56:26.800
That is fine.

56:27.801 --> 56:29.636
It is a promise of our everlasting love.

56:30.386 --> 56:31.679
I do not mind it.

56:34.390 --> 56:35.225
That is right.

56:35.809 --> 56:36.643
It is a promise.

56:41.272 --> 56:44.484
Will you be going to North Fortress
by yourself as arranged?

56:44.567 --> 56:47.987
There will only be peace
and quiet if I leave.

56:49.197 --> 56:50.031
Uk.

56:52.283 --> 56:53.701
I am here to tell you something

56:54.994 --> 56:57.205
that will bring about
neither peace nor quiet.

57:00.917 --> 57:05.130
The pain you will feel
upon learning of it or ignoring it

57:06.881 --> 57:08.842
is something you should endure,

57:09.717 --> 57:11.261
not for me to decide.

57:12.512 --> 57:13.555
That is why I am here.

57:19.686 --> 57:20.979
Naksu will disappear soon.

57:23.314 --> 57:27.652
She believes that no justification
is reasonable enough to stay by your side.

57:29.154 --> 57:30.280
But will this be

57:31.990 --> 57:33.783
a good justification for you?

57:36.161 --> 57:36.995
Yul.

57:38.496 --> 57:39.622
Do you know how I felt

57:41.124 --> 57:43.376
when I decided to feign ignorance…

57:45.503 --> 57:46.880
and leave her behind?

58:04.189 --> 58:05.982
I turned away with the knowledge

58:07.400 --> 58:09.694
that I must slay her
if I acknowledged who she was.

58:33.343 --> 58:34.677
Her approaching death

58:35.803 --> 58:37.722
cannot be an excuse for us to be together.

58:43.895 --> 58:46.981
Instead of using my coming death
as a cowardly excuse to be together…

58:47.565 --> 58:48.399
It is much better…

58:51.736 --> 58:53.321
for us to be tormented instead.

59:11.172 --> 59:13.258
I, Jin Bu-yeon,
the eldest daughter of the Jin family,

59:13.341 --> 59:15.510
have retrieved the plaque
from Gwido to prove

59:16.094 --> 59:17.595
my power as a priestess.

59:32.694 --> 59:35.280
I heard Jang Uk sent Jin Mu to Gwido.

59:35.363 --> 59:36.406
What happened to him?

59:36.489 --> 59:39.492
I found the ice stone that belonged
to that mage of the Choi family

59:40.743 --> 59:41.995
and put it inside of him.

59:44.747 --> 59:45.623
Jin Mu…

59:47.500 --> 59:49.168
will eventually wither away and die.

01:00:14.736 --> 01:00:17.280
It desires to absorb human energy

01:00:17.363 --> 01:00:18.990
like a soul shifter that has run wild.

01:00:19.574 --> 01:00:21.200
So you put that inside of him.

01:00:21.951 --> 01:00:23.786
It may have lost the energy of the sky,

01:00:23.870 --> 01:00:25.455
but it is still an ice stone.

01:00:25.538 --> 01:00:27.707
And you put that inside of him.

01:00:28.333 --> 01:00:30.043
I am impressed by your divine powers.

01:00:32.503 --> 01:00:34.881
If you could put it inside of someone,

01:00:34.964 --> 01:00:38.176
that must mean
you can take it out as well.

01:00:39.135 --> 01:00:41.387
The main purpose
of today's Unanimous Assembly

01:00:41.471 --> 01:00:44.390
is to discuss what to do
with Jang Uk's ice stone.

01:00:44.474 --> 01:00:46.726
Since she can take out the ice stone,

01:00:46.809 --> 01:00:48.603
we can retrieve Jang Uk's ice stone

01:00:48.686 --> 01:00:50.855
if we agree on it today.

01:00:50.938 --> 01:00:55.485
But Jang Uk will die
if the ice stone is removed from his body.

01:00:55.568 --> 01:00:57.654
He should have died three years ago.

01:00:57.737 --> 01:00:59.322
He is only alive due to the decision

01:00:59.405 --> 01:01:01.074
of the royal family
and the Unanimous Assembly.

01:01:01.157 --> 01:01:03.242
If Jang Uk did not stop Jin Mu,

01:01:03.326 --> 01:01:05.912
the fire bird would have emerged
and caused chaos in the world.

01:01:05.995 --> 01:01:07.330
Songrim should not intervene!

01:01:07.914 --> 01:01:11.042
We are only having this conversation
because you decided to be rash

01:01:11.125 --> 01:01:14.045
instead of asking the royal family
or the Unanimous Assembly for permission.

01:01:14.671 --> 01:01:15.546
I took part…

01:01:17.507 --> 01:01:18.633
in their plan.

01:01:18.716 --> 01:01:19.967
Do not intervene.

01:01:21.219 --> 01:01:23.304
You deliberately did so
without my consent.

01:01:24.222 --> 01:01:26.307
- You should not have done that.
- But, Your Majesty…

01:01:28.851 --> 01:01:31.604
We only allowed Jang Uk
to keep that ice stone

01:01:31.688 --> 01:01:33.981
so that he could obliterate
the soul shifters.

01:01:34.065 --> 01:01:35.775
He does not need its power anymore

01:01:35.858 --> 01:01:38.569
since there are
no more soul shifters left.

01:01:38.653 --> 01:01:40.196
- Right.
- I agree.

01:01:40.279 --> 01:01:41.531
- True.
- Take the ice stone back.

01:01:41.614 --> 01:01:43.074
That is only natural.

01:01:43.157 --> 01:01:45.535
- Right.
- He is right.

01:01:50.289 --> 01:01:52.709
If that is what
the Unanimous Assembly decides,

01:01:52.792 --> 01:01:56.003
you must also abide by it
as a fellow member

01:01:56.087 --> 01:01:57.755
and Jinyowon's heiress.

01:01:59.841 --> 01:02:01.676
If that is
what the Unanimous Assembly decides,

01:02:03.344 --> 01:02:04.887
then I must follow their decision.

01:02:17.191 --> 01:02:18.025
Your Highness.

01:02:18.109 --> 01:02:19.944
That is the door to Gwido.

01:02:20.903 --> 01:02:22.280
You can find Jin Mu there.

01:02:22.363 --> 01:02:23.781
You can ask him where the Soul Ejector is

01:02:23.865 --> 01:02:26.284
and how you can perform
the alchemy of souls.

01:02:27.577 --> 01:02:31.122
Yun-o, how did you find
the key to that door?

01:02:32.457 --> 01:02:35.084
My friends from Cheonbugwan helped me.

01:02:35.668 --> 01:02:36.502
Is that so?

01:02:39.714 --> 01:02:40.590
Let us go.

01:02:48.973 --> 01:02:49.807
Uk.

01:02:51.225 --> 01:02:52.059
Where is Bu-yeon?

01:02:52.143 --> 01:02:54.228
She agreed to abide
by the Unanimous Assembly's decision.

01:02:54.937 --> 01:02:55.772
She has left now.

01:03:10.745 --> 01:03:14.582
We were discussing what to do
with the ice stone within you.

01:03:14.665 --> 01:03:17.084
If we decide to retrieve it,

01:03:17.168 --> 01:03:21.881
Jin Bu-yeon, the priestess of Jinyowon,
will take it out of you.

01:03:21.964 --> 01:03:25.593
Did she say that she would abide by it?

01:03:25.676 --> 01:03:26.511
That is right.

01:03:27.094 --> 01:03:31.682
And she exposed
all the sins you have committed.

01:03:37.522 --> 01:03:38.397
Last night,

01:03:39.524 --> 01:03:41.984
he spared one soul shifter.

01:03:42.652 --> 01:03:44.987
He knew that individual
was a soul shifter,

01:03:46.322 --> 01:03:47.865
but he feigned ignorance.

01:03:47.949 --> 01:03:49.700
Is that true?

01:03:51.994 --> 01:03:52.829
Yes.

01:03:53.454 --> 01:03:54.789
I feigned ignorance.

01:04:00.503 --> 01:04:04.006
So did she want me
to slay that soul shifter?

01:04:04.590 --> 01:04:07.969
Please tell him
to stop feigning ignorance.

01:04:10.137 --> 01:04:11.848
Tell him to confirm its existence

01:04:13.015 --> 01:04:14.392
and watch it…

01:04:17.061 --> 01:04:18.312
wither away.

01:04:20.439 --> 01:04:23.192
She gave me a reason
and an excuse to find that soul shifter.

01:04:23.276 --> 01:04:24.777
A reason and an excuse?

01:04:25.486 --> 01:04:28.239
That was your duty.

01:04:28.823 --> 01:04:29.657
In that case,

01:04:30.324 --> 01:04:31.951
I will fulfill my duty

01:04:32.577 --> 01:04:33.995
and no longer feign ignorance.

01:04:36.789 --> 01:04:38.583
I will confirm its existence

01:04:38.666 --> 01:04:40.793
and watch it wither away.

01:04:41.586 --> 01:04:42.420
Now,

01:04:43.629 --> 01:04:45.214
I will leave.

01:04:46.007 --> 01:04:47.341
Where are you going?

01:04:47.425 --> 01:04:49.135
We are discussing what you have done!

01:04:49.218 --> 01:04:51.012
That is over now!

01:05:04.525 --> 01:05:06.694
I will accept your reason and excuse,

01:05:07.570 --> 01:05:08.446
and I will leave.

01:05:13.868 --> 01:05:16.245
Stop uttering such words.

01:05:16.329 --> 01:05:18.623
We are only telling you
to fulfill your duty!

01:05:20.625 --> 01:05:22.585
Are we not retrieving the ice stone?

01:05:33.679 --> 01:05:34.555
What is going on?

01:05:35.389 --> 01:05:36.557
There is still a soul shifter?

01:05:39.310 --> 01:05:40.144
That is right.

01:05:41.354 --> 01:05:42.480
Uk will not return

01:05:44.065 --> 01:05:45.274
until he catches them.

01:07:17.324 --> 01:07:18.284
In the end,

01:07:19.994 --> 01:07:22.872
you used what is between us
as a reason and excuse

01:07:25.082 --> 01:07:26.375
to bring me here.

01:07:28.711 --> 01:07:30.379
My merciless master.

01:07:33.257 --> 01:07:34.633
I am not your master anymore.

01:07:36.969 --> 01:07:37.803
I have already…

01:07:40.473 --> 01:07:41.724
let you go.

01:09:03.973 --> 01:09:06.350
I found him, Your Highness! I see Jin Mu!

01:09:07.059 --> 01:09:08.561
Gwanju!

01:09:18.237 --> 01:09:20.614
You are on the brink of death.

01:09:29.290 --> 01:09:30.124
Jin Mu.

01:09:30.207 --> 01:09:31.792
Tell me one thing before you die.

01:09:32.418 --> 01:09:33.794
One last Soul Ejector remains.

01:09:34.378 --> 01:09:36.005
Where is it? Do you have it?

01:09:37.673 --> 01:09:39.925
Pull yourself together. Where is it?

01:09:49.643 --> 01:09:52.146
Jin Mu. Give me the Soul Ejector.

01:09:52.229 --> 01:09:53.856
You made a promise to me.

01:09:53.939 --> 01:09:57.026
Hand it over before you die.

01:10:00.654 --> 01:10:01.488
Yes.

01:10:01.572 --> 01:10:03.616
Where is it?

01:10:06.368 --> 01:10:09.914
My last Soul Ejector

01:10:12.082 --> 01:10:16.462
is inside the blood
of the mage of the Choi family

01:10:17.755 --> 01:10:21.091
who created it in the first place.

01:10:27.139 --> 01:10:29.642
Are you saying it is inside of me?

01:10:45.824 --> 01:10:47.826
I put it inside your body

01:10:47.910 --> 01:10:50.871
when I was shifting your soul.

01:10:51.580 --> 01:10:54.833
I guess you did not remember that.

01:11:04.301 --> 01:11:07.930
It is all coming back to me now.

01:11:09.181 --> 01:11:11.892
The one who shifted my soul
and locked me up

01:11:12.810 --> 01:11:13.894
was you,

01:11:15.437 --> 01:11:16.480
Jin Mu!

01:11:52.683 --> 01:11:53.892
Gwanju.

01:11:53.976 --> 01:11:57.313
I came here to rescue you.
Let us leave together.

01:11:57.396 --> 01:11:58.605
That is right.

01:11:59.315 --> 01:12:01.567
We will leave this place together.

01:12:03.068 --> 01:12:03.902
No.

01:12:05.279 --> 01:12:07.948
I will leave this place in your body.

01:14:42.811 --> 01:14:44.062
Did you go to Gwido?

01:14:44.146 --> 01:14:46.440
Was Jin Mu still alive?

01:14:46.523 --> 01:14:49.568
So you were the one who sent me there
to save him, Your Majesty.

01:14:50.360 --> 01:14:53.864
He had promised to give me immense powers,

01:14:53.947 --> 01:14:56.158
so I must at least know
how to acquire them.

01:14:56.241 --> 01:14:58.869
So tell me. Did you meet him?

01:14:59.995 --> 01:15:01.914
You are looking at him right now,
Your Majesty.

01:15:03.707 --> 01:15:04.708
Your Majesty.

01:15:05.626 --> 01:15:07.002
Do you still not understand?

01:15:08.962 --> 01:15:10.547
I am Jin Mu.

01:15:15.135 --> 01:15:16.345
You have shifted souls!

01:15:21.433 --> 01:15:24.645
So this is the very power
that you have promised me.

01:15:24.728 --> 01:15:26.939
If we share the power of the ice stone,

01:15:27.481 --> 01:15:30.150
we will live forever
as the strong gain greater power.

01:15:33.278 --> 01:15:36.532
Now, come on out
and let us walk down the path together

01:15:37.574 --> 01:15:40.536
to acquire that very power.

01:17:05.912 --> 01:17:08.832
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:17:09.583 --> 01:17:10.917
There is only one reply I can give you

01:17:11.001 --> 01:17:13.253
in our last moment together.

01:17:13.920 --> 01:17:16.256
We must go to Jinyowon at once
and bring out the fire bird.

01:17:16.340 --> 01:17:18.425
- Bring me the ice stone.
- Your Majesty!

01:17:18.508 --> 01:17:21.345
What are you trying to do by fooling
the King and Unanimous Assembly?

01:17:22.054 --> 01:17:23.388
Uk.

01:17:23.472 --> 01:17:26.475
Uk, Jin is…

01:17:27.934 --> 01:17:31.938
I fear that the same kind of chaos
may occur once again.

01:17:32.022 --> 01:17:33.023
The fire bird will awaken.

01:17:33.106 --> 01:17:34.941
I was told that
it is going to happen no matter what.

01:17:38.195 --> 01:17:43.200
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
